30f9a71d-d8ed-431b-8ffe-7da395c203d8	T5Iuyxy6QgvXQojk	Trung Le	2026-07-26 11:06:12.559+00	2026-07-26 11:06:12.559+00	[{"parameters":{"public":true,"options":{}},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[48,64],"id":"a33e85e2-6bd6-4a8f-8dfd-b198f9609063","name":"When chat message received","webhookId":"2601ec22-61c0-4192-9184-7869aeb24912"},{"parameters":{"modelName":"models/gemini-2.5-flash-preview-05-20","options":{}},"id":"fb052d4f-772b-488d-b524-8ca9d25ba575","name":"Google Gemini Chat","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatGoogleGemini","typeVersion":1,"position":[272,320],"credentials":{"googlePalmApi":{"id":"2jeGSse7XsWrQNNy","name":"Google ACC pntechcom.hue"}}},{"parameters":{"requestMethod":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:5001/execute","jsonParameters":true,"options":{},"bodyParametersJson":"={{ $json.output }}"},"id":"7d0342d6-5d3a-4339-88c7-9c60baf23b6e","name":"Send to Python Agent","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":1,"position":[656,64]},{"parameters":{},"type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.memoryBufferWindow","typeVersion":1.3,"position":[352,320],"id":"55013528-8f3c-4009-873e-b104288fda7d","name":"Simple Memory"},{"parameters":{"text":"=Bạn là một trợ lý thông minh có khả năng tạo ra các chuỗi hành động để tự động hóa máy tính. Bạn sẽ tạo ra một mảng JSON các đối tượng hành động dựa trên yêu cầu của người dùng. Các loại hành động hợp lệ bao gồm:\\n\\n1.  **Gõ phím:** `{\\"type\\": \\"press\\", \\"key\\": \\"tên_phím\\"}` (ví dụ: \\"enter\\", \\"esc\\", \\"space\\", \\"ctrl\\", \\"alt\\", \\"tab\\", \\"backspace\\")\\n2.  **Viết văn bản:** `{\\"type\\": \\"write\\", \\"text\\": \\"chuỗi_văn_bản\\"}`\\n3.  **Gõ văn bản bằng cách nhấn từng phím (hữu ích cho các trường hợp đặc biệt như bộ gõ tiếng Việt hoặc không chấp nhận dán):** `{\\"type\\": \\"type_by_press\\", \\"text\\": \\"chuỗi_văn_bản\\"}`\\n4.  **Chờ:** `{\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": số_giây}`\\n5.  **Tổ hợp phím:** `{\\"type\\": \\"hotkey\\", \\"keys\\": [\\"phím1\\", \\"phím2\\"]}` (ví dụ: [\\"ctrl\\", \\"c\\"], [\\"alt\\", \\"f4\\"])\\n6.  **Click chuột:** `{\\"type\\": \\"click\\", \\"x\\": tọa_độ_X, \\"y\\": tọa_độ_Y}`\\n7.  **Chuyển đổi chế độ gõ tiếng Việt/Anh:** `{\\"type\\": \\"toggle_ime\\", \\"mode\\": \\"english\\"}` (chuyển sang tiếng Anh) hoặc `{\\"type\\": \\"toggle_ime\\", \\"mode\\": \\"vietnamese\\"}` (chuyển sang tiếng Việt). Hành động này sử dụng tổ hợp phím **Ctrl+Shift**.\\n\\nLuôn trả về một đối tượng JSON duy nhất có khóa là \\"actions\\" và giá trị là một mảng các đối tượng hành động. **Quan trọng: Tuyệt đối không bao gồm bất kỳ định dạng Markdown code block nào (ví dụ: ```json, ```) trong phản hồi của bạn. Chỉ trả về đối tượng JSON thuần túy.**\\n\\n**Xử lý nội dung bẳn (Quan trọng):**\\nBước 1: kiểm tra **tất cả nội dung văn bản** cần gỏ là kiểu tiếng việt hay là tiếng anh.\\nBước 2: \\n  - Nếu kiểu tiếng Việt thì áp dụng  **Quy tắc cho Tiếng Việt (có dấu hoặc không dấu):** hãy biến đổi văn bản đầu vào sang dạng TELEX tương ứng trước khi đưa vào hành động `type_by_press`. Ví dụ: \\"tôi thích\\" thành \\"tooi thisch\\" hoặc \\"xin chào\\" thành \\"xin chafo\\".\\n - Nếu kiểu tiếng Anh thì :\\n        + **Trước khi gõ Tiếng Anh:** Thêm hành động `{\\"type\\": \\"toggle_ime\\", \\"mode\\": \\"english\\"}` (sử dụng Ctrl+Shift để chuyển sang tiếng Anh).\\n         +   **Thời gian chờ:** Luôn thêm `{\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 0.2}` sau mỗi hành động `toggle_ime` để bộ gõ có thời gian chuyển đổi trạng thái.\\n        +   **Gõ nội dung:** Sử dụng `write` để gõ nhanh.\\n        +   **Sau khi gõ:** Thêm hành động `{\\"type\\": \\"toggle_ime\\", \\"mode\\": \\"vietnamese\\"}` (sử dụng Ctrl+Shift để chuyển về tiếng Việt).\\n        +   **Thời gian chờ:** Luôn thêm `{\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 0.2}` sau mỗi hành động `toggle_ime` để bộ gõ có thời gian chuyển đổi trạng thái.\\n\\n**Ví dụ:**\\n**1. Gõ văn bản tiếng Anh thuần túy (Chuyển sang Anh, dùng `write`, rồi về Việt):**\\nNếu người dùng nói \\"Mở word\\", bạn nên trả về:\\n{\\"actions\\": [\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"toggle_ime\\", \\"mode\\": \\"english\\"}, // Chuyển sang tiếng Anh (Ctrl+Shift)\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 0.2},\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"hotkey\\", \\"keys\\": [\\"win\\", \\"r\\"]},\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"write\\", \\"text\\": \\"winword\\"},\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"press\\", \\"key\\": \\"enter\\"},\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 0.2},\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"toggle_ime\\", \\"mode\\": \\"vietnamese\\"}, // Trở về tiếng Việt (Ctrl+Shift)\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 0.2},\\n]}\\n\\n**2. Gõ văn bản tiếng Việt có dấu (Mặc định tiếng Việt, dùng `type_by_press` với TELEX):**\\nNếu người dùng nói \\"mở notepad gỏ Nguyễn Văn A\\", bạn nên trả về:\\n{\\"actions\\": [\\n  {\\"type\\": \\"toggle_ime\\", \\"mode\\": \\"english\\"}, \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 0.2},   \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"hotkey\\", \\"keys\\": [\\"win\\", \\"r\\"]}, \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"write\\", \\"text\\": \\"notepad\\"}, \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"press\\", \\"key\\": \\"enter\\"}, \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 0.2}, \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"toggle_ime\\", \\"mode\\": \\"vietnamese\\"}, \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 0.2}, \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"wait\\", \\"seconds\\": 1}, \\n  {\\"type\\": \\"type_by_press\\", \\"text\\": \\"Nguyeexn Vaawn A\\"}\\n]}\\n\\nBây giờ, hãy tạo ra các hành động JSON cho yêu cầu sau: {{ $json.chatInput }}.\\n","options":{}},"id":"9d00d583-d4d3-4988-8653-ca32c7ac7451","name":"Gemini AI","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent","typeVersion":1,"position":[288,64]}]	{"When chat message received":{"main":[[{"node":"Gemini AI","type":"main","index":0}]]},"Google Gemini Chat":{"ai_languageModel":[[{"node":"Gemini AI","type":"ai_languageModel","index":0}]]},"Simple Memory":{"ai_memory":[[{"node":"Gemini AI","type":"ai_memory","index":0}]]},"Gemini AI":{"main":[[{"node":"Send to Python Agent","type":"main","index":0}]]}}	\N	t	\N	[]
6d3990d4-3f0b-4234-9288-93d0f500db59	DSIr8a18SxxeZ3gS	import	2026-07-24 13:10:09.395+00	2026-07-24 13:10:09.395+00	[{"parameters":{"content":"## 🏭 SDLC 7-Step Enterprise AI Team\\n\\n**Quy trình:** Chat Trigger → 7 bước SDLC → Final Output\\n\\n**Mỗi bước gồm 3 node:**\\n- 🔵 **Executor** — thực thi nhiệm vụ\\n- 🟡 **Critic** — phản biện, tìm lỗi\\n- 🟢 **Synthesizer** — tổng hợp kết quả tối ưu\\n- ✅ **Quality Gate** — kiểm tra trước khi sang bước kế\\n\\n**Models:**\\n- Executor: `mistral-nemo` (nhanh)\\n- Critic: `qwen2.5:7b` (nhẹ)\\n- Synthesizer: `deepseek-r1:32b` (chất lượng cao)\\n- Coder: `qwen2.5-coder:14b` (chuyên code)","height":320,"width":400,"color":7},"id":"290e940c-bc6f-4fb9-8614-52434d405a71","name":"Sticky Note","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[2544,1680]},{"parameters":{"options":{}},"id":"487494dd-8851-4a71-a2c6-293a018a80a8","name":"When chat message received","type":"@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.chatTrigger","typeVersion":1.1,"position":[3024,1808],"webhookId":"sdlc-ai-team"},{"parameters":{"content":"### 📥 Input\\nNhập yêu cầu vào cửa sổ chat.\\nVí dụ:\\n*\\"Viết script Python scan port 80/443 dải 192.168.1.0/24\\"*","height":100,"width":300,"color":6},"id":"5666ad15-9950-468f-bd19-03a5beb7f0ab","name":"Sticky Note1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[2976,1680]},{"parameters":{"values":{"string":[{"name":"task_id","value":"={{ $now.format('X') }}"},{"name":"description","value":"={{ $json.chatInput }}"}]},"options":{}},"id":"2d4564df-ced7-4c0d-84b8-eb7e3940ce93","name":"Set Task","type":"n8n-nodes-base.set","typeVersion":2,"position":[3248,1808]},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"let retry = 0;\\ntry { retry = $('Logic Control').item.retry_count + 1; } catch (e) { retry = 0; }\\nif (retry > 2) throw new Error('SDLC failed after 2 retries.');\\nreturn { retry_count: retry, is_retrying: retry > 0 };"},"id":"99d28778-b8eb-4f48-ab8f-4bb46ad6bf4e","name":"Logic Control","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[3472,1808]},{"parameters":{"content":"### 🔄 Retry Logic\\nNếu Quality Gate thất bại, workflow tự retry tối đa **2 lần** trước khi dừng và báo lỗi.","height":100,"width":260,"color":3},"id":"d6dd5ccf-a8f3-4a6d-a2b3-51bd912b9013","name":"Sticky Note2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[3392,1680]},{"parameters":{"content":"### Step 1: Idea Generation\\nPhân tích tính khả thi, xác định rủi ro và các module cần có.\\n\\n**Executor:** `mistral-nemo:latest`  \\n**Critic:** `qwen2.5:7b`  \\n**Synthesizer:** `deepseek-coder-v2:16b`","height":146,"width":760,"color":5},"id":"699322b0-e6ae-448d-ab74-af60180bec1c","name":"Sticky Note Step1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[3616,1888]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'mistral-nemo:latest', prompt: 'VAI TRO: IDEA ANALYST\\\\nINPUT:\\\\n' + $('Set Task').first().json.description + '\\\\n\\\\nPhan tich yeu cau va danh gia tinh kha thi:\\\\n1. Mo ta y tuong cot loi (1 doan)\\\\n2. Van de can giai quyet\\\\n3. 3-5 tinh nang chinh\\\\n4. Tinh kha thi ky thuat: De/Trung binh/Kho + ly do\\\\n5. Rui ro tiem an va cach xu ly', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"56df1b55-562e-4be5-9704-0d42fa441721","name":"Step1 Executor","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3632,2048]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'qwen2.5:7b', prompt: 'VAI TRO: IDEA CRITIC\\\\nY TUONG DA PHAN TICH:\\\\n' + $('Step1 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nPhan bien y tuong:\\\\n1. Luan diem nao chua thuyet phuc?\\\\n2. Rui ro nao bi bo sot?\\\\n3. Feasibility co duoc danh gia chinh xac?\\\\n4. Co giai phap don gian hon?\\\\n5. Diem manh nao can giu lai?', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"2d2696f6-b6d4-406a-b4b6-1b9dd99b7592","name":"Step1 Critic","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3872,2048]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'deepseek-coder-v2:16b', prompt: 'SYNTHESIZER - BUOC 1: Idea Generation\\\\n\\\\nBAN THUC THI:\\\\n' + $('Step1 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nPHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step1 Critic').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nNHIEM VU TONG HOP:\\\\nTong hop BAN MO TA Y TUONG CUOI CUNG:\\\\n- Vision statement (1 cau)\\\\n- Core features (bullet)\\\\n- Feasibility verdict\\\\n- Key risks & mitigations\\\\nSan sang cho Requirement Analysis.', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"11ab0a9c-25f6-441c-82c6-d228e13ea864","name":"Step1 Synthesizer","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[4112,2048]},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"const synth = $('Step1 Synthesizer').last().json.response || '';\\nif (!synth || synth.length < 50) throw new Error('Quality Gate 1 FAIL: output too short');\\nreturn { step1_result: synth, step1_passed: true };"},"id":"b7bc35ce-3881-4d31-a612-6ef7c659e4e0","name":"Quality Gate 1","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[4352,2048]},{"parameters":{"content":"### Step 2: Requirement Analysis\\nChuyển ý tưởng thành tài liệu yêu cầu rõ ràng, đo lường được.\\n\\n**Executor:** `mistral-nemo:latest`  \\n**Critic:** `qwen2.5:7b`  \\n**Synthesizer:** `deepseek-coder-v2:16b`","height":146,"width":760,"color":5},"id":"696f6740-31fc-4755-854d-7a9af9b1c0a9","name":"Sticky Note Step2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[3616,2208]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'mistral-nemo:latest', prompt: 'VAI TRO: BUSINESS ANALYST\\\\nINPUT:\\\\n' + $('Step1 Synthesizer').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nViet SRS dua tren y tuong da duoc phe duyet:\\\\n1. Functional Requirements (FR) - liet ke day du\\\\n2. Non-Functional Requirements (NFR) voi con so cu the\\\\n3. User Stories: As a... I want... So that...\\\\n4. Acceptance Criteria tung tinh nang\\\\n5. Out of scope (nhung gi KHONG lam)', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"b5732104-b729-44c2-9170-941200732185","name":"Step2 Executor","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3632,2352]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'qwen2.5:7b', prompt: 'VAI TRO: REQUIREMENT CRITIC\\\\nTAI LIEU CAN PHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step2 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nReview tai lieu yeu cau:\\\\n1. FR nao con mo ho, khong do luong duoc?\\\\n2. NFR nao thieu con so cu the?\\\\n3. User story nao thieu acceptance criteria?\\\\n4. Co conflict giua requirements?\\\\n5. Thieu edge case nao quan trong?', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"73ce4f2c-5287-4e8a-9887-a36366974c1f","name":"Step2 Critic","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3872,2352]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'deepseek-coder-v2:16b', prompt: 'SYNTHESIZER - BUOC 2: Requirement Analysis\\\\n\\\\nBAN THUC THI:\\\\n' + $('Step2 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nPHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step2 Critic').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nNHIEM VU TONG HOP:\\\\nTao SRS CUOI CUNG:\\\\nFR list | NFR list | User Stories | Acceptance Criteria | Constraints\\\\nDu chi tiet de Architect thiet ke khong can hoi them.', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"3f76c987-147f-41c6-8e8b-7875b802cc89","name":"Step2 Synthesizer","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[4112,2352]},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"const synth = $('Step2 Synthesizer').last().json.response || '';\\nif (!synth || synth.length < 50) throw new Error('Quality Gate 2 FAIL: output too short');\\nreturn { step2_result: synth, step2_passed: true };"},"id":"a178a7f1-fbed-48e5-95aa-e41454e08834","name":"Quality Gate 2","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[4352,2352]},{"parameters":{"content":"### Step 3: Product Design\\nQuyết định tech stack, kiến trúc, thư viện trước khi code.\\n\\n**Executor:** `deepseek-coder-v2:16b`  \\n**Critic:** `qwen2.5:7b`  \\n**Synthesizer:** `deepseek-coder-v2:16b`","height":130,"width":760,"color":4},"id":"d618e758-ad54-4061-97d8-e613706f0863","name":"Sticky Note Step3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[3616,2512]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'deepseek-coder-v2:16b', prompt: 'VAI TRO: SOLUTION ARCHITECT\\\\nINPUT:\\\\n' + $('Step2 Synthesizer').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nThiet ke giai phap ky thuat dua tren SRS:\\\\n1. Tech stack: ngon ngu, framework, thu vien chinh (giai thich ly do chon vs lua chon khac)\\\\n2. System architecture: modules va interfaces\\\\n3. Data structures & schemas chinh\\\\n4. Security & performance decisions\\\\n5. Thu tu implementation', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"de62c9c9-436a-4115-bff6-19c546cccd21","name":"Step3 Executor","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3632,2640]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'qwen2.5:7b', prompt: 'VAI TRO: DESIGN CRITIC\\\\nTAI LIEU CAN PHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step3 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nPhan bien thiet ke:\\\\n1. Tech stack phu hop voi NFR chua?\\\\n2. Over-engineering hoac under-engineering?\\\\n3. Single points of failure?\\\\n4. Thu vien co van de license/maintenance?\\\\n5. Security vulnerabilities trong thiet ke?', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"1ae89e02-6f98-4021-bda6-274d61be7c7d","name":"Step3 Critic","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3872,2640]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'deepseek-coder-v2:16b', prompt: 'SYNTHESIZER - BUOC 3: Product Design\\\\n\\\\nBAN THUC THI:\\\\n' + $('Step3 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nPHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step3 Critic').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nNHIEM VU TONG HOP:\\\\nTao TECHNICAL DESIGN DOCUMENT:\\\\n- Final tech stack (justified)\\\\n- Architecture overview\\\\n- Module breakdown voi interfaces\\\\n- Data models\\\\n- Implementation order\\\\nDu chi tiet de Coder triet khai ngay.', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"072c72f8-524d-4972-9639-4db696e2b634","name":"Step3 Synthesizer","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[4112,2640]},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"const synth = $('Step3 Synthesizer').last().json.response || '';\\nif (!synth || synth.length < 50) throw new Error('Quality Gate 3 FAIL: output too short');\\nreturn { step3_result: synth, step3_passed: true };"},"id":"45365460-9024-4edd-93e5-b56dc6ecd5c7","name":"Quality Gate 3","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[4352,2640]},{"parameters":{"content":"### Step 4: Product Development\\nViết code theo đúng thiết kế. Critic dùng mistral-nemo để hiểu code tốt hơn.\\n\\n**Executor:** `qwen2.5-coder:14b`  \\n**Critic:** `mistral-nemo:latest`  \\n**Synthesizer:** `deepseek-coder-v2:16b`","height":130,"width":760,"color":2},"id":"1c7a78db-62ab-4f1a-98ec-357ff45f666d","name":"Sticky Note Step4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[3616,2800]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'qwen2.5-coder:14b', prompt: 'VAI TRO: SENIOR DEVELOPER\\\\nINPUT:\\\\n' + $('Step3 Synthesizer').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nViet code hoan chinh theo Technical Design Document:\\\\n- Tuan thu dung tech stack da phe duyet\\\\n- Error handling day du\\\\n- Logging co cau truc\\\\n- Docstrings cho logic phuc tap\\\\n- KHONG them thu vien ngoai danh sach\\\\nChi tra ve code, khong giai thich.', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"1b24f012-6cad-479e-8f6b-226b9086e443","name":"Step4 Executor","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3632,2944]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'mistral-nemo:latest', prompt: 'VAI TRO: CODE REVIEWER\\\\nTAI LIEU CAN PHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step4 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nReview code theo checklist:\\\\nSECURITY: injection, path traversal, input validation, secrets in code\\\\nPERFORMANCE: memory leaks, blocking calls, inefficient loops\\\\nRELIABILITY: unhandled exceptions, race conditions\\\\nMAINTAINABILITY: duplication, naming\\\\nDanh gia: PASS / NEEDS_FIX voi danh sach van de cu the.', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"229750fb-6588-4e8f-844d-ad5bc03175e7","name":"Step4 Critic","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3872,2944]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'deepseek-coder-v2:16b', prompt: 'SYNTHESIZER - BUOC 4: Product Development\\\\n\\\\nBAN THUC THI:\\\\n' + $('Step4 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nPHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step4 Critic').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nNHIEM VU TONG HOP:\\\\nFix CRITICAL/HIGH issues tu review. Tra ve JSON:\\\\n{\\"code\\": \\"...\\", \\"filename\\": \\"...\\", \\"dependencies\\": [...], \\"run_command\\": \\"...\\"}', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"48f8b7cd-ed63-4c59-afbd-e21d94673846","name":"Step4 Synthesizer","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[4112,2944]},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"const synth = $('Step4 Synthesizer').last().json.response || '';\\nif (!synth || synth.length < 50) throw new Error('Quality Gate 4 FAIL: output too short');\\nreturn { step4_result: synth, step4_passed: true };"},"id":"54fb0ff2-ec0f-449d-bd8c-747dc1b53519","name":"Quality Gate 4","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[4352,2944]},{"parameters":{"content":"### Step 5: Integration & Testing\\nViết test cases thực tế (pytest), không chỉ mô tả.\\n\\n**Executor:** `mistral-nemo:latest`  \\n**Critic:** `qwen2.5:7b`  \\n**Synthesizer:** `deepseek-coder-v2:16b`","height":130,"width":760,"color":3},"id":"fb8b6287-56f3-4208-89d0-9f3834c65665","name":"Sticky Note Step5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[3616,3104]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'mistral-nemo:latest', prompt: 'VAI TRO: QA ENGINEER\\\\nINPUT:\\\\n' + $('Step4 Synthesizer').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nViet test suite (pytest) day du:\\\\n1. Unit tests tung function chinh\\\\n2. Integration test scenarios\\\\n3. Edge cases & boundary conditions\\\\n4. Performance test scenarios\\\\n5. Security test cases\\\\nViet code test thuc te, khong chi mo ta.', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"73d5e876-1ed8-4508-83d0-8e4908afe88a","name":"Step5 Executor","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3632,3248]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'qwen2.5:7b', prompt: 'VAI TRO: QA CRITIC\\\\nTAI LIEU CAN PHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step5 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nReview test suite:\\\\n1. Test coverage du (uoc tinh %)?\\\\n2. Thieu test case nao quan trong?\\\\n3. Test nao fragile/false positive?\\\\n4. Edge case nao bi bo sot?\\\\n5. Test data co realistic?', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"23a2303c-8794-4568-9063-462a74fc38fa","name":"Step5 Critic","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[3872,3248]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://host.docker.internal:11434/api/generate","sendBody":true,"specifyBody":"json","jsonBody":"={{ JSON.stringify({ model: 'deepseek-coder-v2:16b', prompt: 'SYNTHESIZER - BUOC 5: Integration & Testing\\\\n\\\\nBAN THUC THI:\\\\n' + $('Step5 Executor').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nPHAN BIEN:\\\\n' + $('Step5 Critic').last().json.response + '\\\\n\\\\nNHIEM VU TONG HOP:\\\\nTao FINAL TEST SUITE:\\\\n{\\"test_code\\": \\"...\\", \\"test_count\\": N, \\"coverage_estimate\\": \\"X%\\", \\"critical_paths_tested\\": [...]}', stream: false }) }}","options":{}},"id":"f3fe1f79-40ca-43ab-bc78-fcbe9b8352e5","name":"Step5 Synthesizer","type":"n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest","typeVersion":4.1,"position":[4112,3248]},{"parameters":{"jsCode":"const synth = $('Step5 Synthesizer').last().json.response || '';\\nif (!synth || synth.length < 50) throw new Error('Quality Gate 5 FAIL: output too short');\\nreturn { step5_result: synth, step5_passed: true };"},"id":"954347f5-8031-4883-a059-60d2711afffc","name":"Quality Gate 5","type":"n8n-nodes-base.code","typeVersion":2,"position":[4352,3248]},{"parameters":{"content":"### Step 6: Deployment\\nTạo Dockerfile, docker-compose, rollback plan và health checks.\\n\\n**Executor:** `deepseek-coder-v2:16b`  \\n**Critic:** `qwen2.5:7b`  \\n**Synthesizer:** `deepseek-coder-v2:16b`","height":130,"width":760,"color":6},"id":"d18d2ec5-9b8e-412c-ab71-69e10712c145","name":"Sticky Note Step6","type":"n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote","typeVersion":1,"position":[3616,3408]},{"parameters":{"method":"POST","url":"http://hos